  "content": "\n\n<h2><strong>Mojang 黑色背景</strong></h2>\n<h3><span>將 Mojang 載入畫面的白色背景改為黑色<br>Minecraft 1.14 及以上版本</span></h3>\n<p><span>必須安裝 OptiFine 才能生效！</span><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">optifine.net</a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mojang-black-background/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>下載</strong></a></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/282/6/mojang-logo-black.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"326\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\nMinecraft 1.16+\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/301/122/mojangslogo.jpg\" width=\"600\" height=\"328\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5>Minecraft 1.17 及以上版本：</h5>\n<h5>Mojang 已在 Minecraft 中新增黑色背景選項！！！</h5>\n<h5>前往 選項 > 無障礙設定 > 單色標誌 並啟用<br><br>我的其他作品：</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/dark-transparent-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">深色半透明介面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-visibility-of-ores\" rel=\"nofollow\">提升礦石可見度</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br>該資源包也可於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmojang-black-background\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 取得</p>",
